Subject: Re: Manually matching the MIRT log likelihood output
Message-ID: <hzF1buoLtAQ.QpdWhaWmAQAJ@mirt-package.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <hzF1buoLtAQ.rgUCvBWjAQAJ@mirt-package.groups.google.com>
